Description: black & white toolkit for KDE Plasma 6
 Grimoire Linux is one app with a set of black & white desktop tools
 ("spells") for KDE Plasma 6 on Wayland:
  * MuraL: customize wallpaper playlists and video wallpapers, lock screen,
    splash, login, boot, taskbar, colors, icons, fonts and cursor
  * SightsL: a click-through crosshair overlay above fullscreen games
  * VaultL: a file manager that keeps Downloads tidy, with undo
  * OptimizeL: speed tweaks as on/off switches that turn back off cleanly
  * SystemL: a system monitor with graphs, processes, services and alerts
  * TerminalL, ShotL, FocusL and NetL: a terminal, screenshots and screen
    recording, a focus timer and a network monitor
 .
 Anything that needs root asks through pkexec and a whitelisted helper.
 There is no telemetry.
